  useOnlineStatus         → the reactive `online` field of QueryErrorInput (P1/S8 seam).
  {{thing}} not found      → "%@ not found" printf template fed resourceName ?? localized "Resource".
  telemetry               → view.opened surface="QueryError" via QueryErrorModel.start (P1/S11), OSLog default.
  states (P4 leaf map)    → error = every branch (the surface IS the error state); offline = the WifiOff branch
                            (+ one-shot auto-retry on reconnect); stale ≈ the transient "waiting" branch (back-off
                            + auto refresh, no CTA); loading/empty = N/A for an error banner — the web returns
                            null with no error, so kind==.none renders nothing and the host shows real content.

